id: space-helmet
name: Space Helmet
kind: gear
itemType: accessory
tags: tech
craftDC: Expert
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Unbreathable Environments are not, while worn.
text: >
  Space Helmet [Tech]: An airtight helmet that offers you breathable air.
  –Craft DC: Expert
  –Effects: While you are wearing this Accessory, ignore Unbreathable Environments.

---

# Ignored, not survived: no Survival Check, no Held Breath, no Suffocating from them - on
# the ground or in Local and Deep Space. Put on in the middle of one, it is leaving it; taken
# off, it is walking back in, and the Check is offered again.
[passive]
forbid unbreathableEnvironments;
